# Generated by `flutter build web`. A committed built copy overrides the
# generated one and pins a stale CanvasKit, which breaks rendering after a
# Flutter upgrade. web/flutter_bootstrap.js is committed, but only as a
# template ({{flutter_js}}, {{flutter_build_config}}) that each build fills in.
/web/flutter.js
/web/canvaskit/

